        <h1 class="post-detail__title">What Generosity Looks Like</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>These smiles reflect something bigger than funding. They illustrate a community coming together to uplift neighbors, champion important causes, and invest in a brighter future. Thank you to every donor who gave, every volunteer who contributed time and talent, and every nonprofit leader whose dedication inspires us all. Together, you make Tin Cup possible!</p>

